cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the corrected corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "Telugu Traditional Grammar — Retrieval-Augmented Study Tool"
abstract: >-
  A retrieval-augmented study tool over the Telugu traditional grammar corpus
  (బాలవ్యాకరణము and ప్రౌఢవ్యాకరణము with their ఘంటాపథము commentaries, the
  వ్యాకరణ పదకోశము, and స్ఫూర్తిశ్రీ). Answers are drawn from the commentaries
  themselves, with each sutra quoted in full and cited to its printed source.
type: software
